  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LIFE-AR 2024 GRANT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LIFE-AR is an initiative led by the LDC Group to support and deliver the &#x2018;LDC 2050 Vision&#x2019; for all LDCs to be on climate-resilient development pathways by 2030 and deliver net-zero emissions by 2050. The aim of the initiative is to move away from business-as-usual approaches to a more ambitious and effective climate response led by LDCs themselves. This approach prioritises long-term cross-sectoral capacity building for inclusive and sustainable results, by regaining LDC agency over adaptation efforts (currently strongly controlled by the UN system) to support climate-vulnerable communities who need it the most. LIFE-AR is committed to monitoring and aiding the delivery of locally-led governance centred on gender transformation and social justice. One of LIFE-AR&#x2019;s core values is promoting gender equality and social inclusion.</narrative>
  </description>
